  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Together for the victims of the Middle East</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Conflict affected people in the Middle East are in need of humanitarian assistance. Dutch public campaign SHO / Giro 555 funding is used by Cordaid to alleviate suffering in Lebanon, Gaza and the Westbank.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support about 150,000 people that are affected in the Gaza, the Westbank and Lebanon by providing support in sectors WASH, FSL, MPC, Health, Protection and Mine actions.</narrative>
  </description>
